,"closed_at":"2026-07-02T17:54:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in 4.7.stable\n- In 4.6.2.stable, the issue is not present.\n\nThe commit related to this pull request https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114678 seems to be the culprit.\nWe built a custom version of Godot 4.7 with this commit reverted and the issue is *not* present.\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 15.7.5 - Godot 4.7.stable - Metal 3.2 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Apple - Apple M1 Max (Apple7)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn a scene where a directional light and an orthogonal camera are used, some objects won't have any shadow projected. We set the camera farplane to 100.0 to make sure the shadows are displayed in high quality.\n\nTo demonstrate the issue, we used a scene with many cubes, and their shadow projected on a plane. Here is what it looks like in 4.6 (what you see are the projected shadows):\n<img width=\"593\" height=\"661\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2cfecf2a-49b4-4df2-b43d-7af7dfda70cd\" />\n\nAnd here is what the shadows look like in 4.7:\n<img width=\"614\" height=\"602\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/321c7127-9277-44e8-9c82-c5f668160cd7\" />\n\nNote that when moving the camera, some shadows will appear.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee the \"Minimal reproduction project\".\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere is the project used to demonstrate the issue : [shadow_cull_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29145205/shadow_cull_mrp.zip).\nJust open the project and the camera should be in orthogonal mode and correctly positioned to witness the issue.\n\nThis file is the project used on the https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114678 pull request.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120457/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120457/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}